
  ✓ init: 1 done

  Worktrees folder  ../.trees
  Base branch       main
  .env from         example
  .env files        apps/api/.env, apps/web/.env
  On create         pnpm install, pnpm db:generate (in apps/api) (goes on if it fails)
  On clean          docker compose down
  Settings file     .git/wtm/config.toml

  → wtm-next create   create a worktree to get started
  → wtm relocate      move the worktrees made elsewhere into the folder

